  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&apos;USAID a expurg&#xe9; ce champ conform&#xe9;ment aux exceptions d&#xe9;crites dans la loi de 2016 sur la transparence et la responsabilit&#xe9; de l&apos;aide &#xe9;trang&#xe8;re.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&apos;USAID a expurg&#xe9; ce champ conform&#xe9;ment aux exceptions d&#xe9;crites dans la loi de 2016 sur la transparence et la responsabilit&#xe9; de l&apos;aide &#xe9;trang&#xe8;re.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Siguiri Agriculture Development Activity (SADA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&apos;USAID a expurg&#xe9; ce champ conform&#xe9;ment aux exceptions d&#xe9;crites dans la loi de 2016 sur la transparence et la responsabilit&#xe9; de l&apos;aide &#xe9;trang&#xe8;re.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Pand&#xe9;mie de grippe et autres menaces &#xe9;mergentes (PIOET)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Siguiri Agriculture Development Activity (SADA) is a private sector Global Development Alliance between USAID Guinea and Socit AngloGold Ashanti de Guine (SAG). Implemented by ACDI/VOCA, SADA will use a private sector-led approach to increase opportunities for individuals and communities affected by mining activities in the Siguiri prefecture. SADA will achieve this through investments, capacity building, and stakeholder coordination in the cashew value chain, including a medium-scale processing facility, cashew nurseries, as well as bundling of extension, inputs, and market access services for smallholder farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
